            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(k+1/2<\\sqrt{k^2+k+1}<k+1\\) を示すと、最も近い整数が \\(k+1\\) と決まります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "N(\\sqrt{k^2+k+1})=k+1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(\\sqrt{k^2+k+1})=k+1-\\sqrt{k^2+k+1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "積分では各整数 \\(m\\) から \\(m+1\\) までを、中央の \\(m+1/2\\) で2つに分けます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
