        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kitasato-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(\\mathrm{BS}:\\mathrm{SC}=6:1\\) からSの位置ベクトルの係数比は1:6です。Rも直線AS上にあるので、ARの2係数の比を合わせます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{x-3}{9}:\\frac{12-x}{3x}=1:6",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2x^2-5x-12=0\\Longrightarrow x=4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(\\mathrm{AS}:\\mathrm{AR}=9:7\\) より、三角形BCRは三角形ABCの \\(2/9\\) 倍です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "[\\triangle BCR]=\\left(\\frac12\\cdot6\\cdot4\\sin\\frac\\pi3\\right)\\frac29=\\frac{4\\sqrt3}{3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kitasato-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "別解",
            "text": "原本はメネラウスとチェバを使う別解も示しています。垂足の比からx=4、続いてSR:RA=2:7を得る流れです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{\\mathrm{AP}}{\\mathrm{PB}}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm{BS}}{\\mathrm{SC}}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm{CQ}}{\\mathrm{QA}}=1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{\\mathrm{SR}}{\\mathrm{RA}}=\\frac27",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　箱の遷移を表にする",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "3回の和が8になる並びを、2回目に3を引く場合と1回目に3を引く場合に分けます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "P(\\text{和}=8)=\\frac{3}{32}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kitasato-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "2回目に3を引く道筋は、1回目が3か、3以外かの2通りです。条件付き確率は該当道筋を全該当道筋で割ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{\\frac14\\cdot\\frac12}{\\frac14\\cdot\\frac12+\\frac34\\cdot\\frac14}=\\frac25",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "p_{n+1}=p_n\\cdot\\frac12+(1-p_n)\\cdot\\frac14=\\frac14p_n+\\frac14",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "p_{n+1}-\\frac13=\\frac14\\left(p_n-\\frac13\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "p_n=-\\frac13\\left(\\frac14\\right)^n+\\frac13\\Longrightarrow\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}p_n=\\frac13",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kitasato-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問　増減から面積・回転体へ進む",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　微分して増減表を作る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f'(x)=2+\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f'(x)=0\\Longrightarrow x=-\\frac2{\\sqrt5}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "端点と停留点を比較し、最小値は \\(-\\sqrt5\\)、最大値は2です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　直線から曲線を引く",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-function-graph",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\int_0^1\\left(1-x+\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\right)dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kitasato-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p009",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\) の積分は単位円の4分の1、または \\(x=\\sin\\theta\\) の置換で計算します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\frac12+\\frac\\pi4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　x軸回転は円板法",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(x)=0\\Longrightarrow x=\\frac1{\\sqrt5}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V_x=\\pi\\int_0^{1/\\sqrt5}\\left(2x-\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\right)^2dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "平方を展開し、\\(x\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\) は \\(t=1-x^2\\) と置換します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kitasato-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p010",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V_x=\\frac{2\\sqrt5-4}{3}\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4)　y軸回転はxをyで表す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y=2x-\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\Longrightarrow x=\\frac{2y+\\sqrt{5-y^2}}5",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "外側の円板法の体積から、y軸と直線y=x+1が作る円錐の体積を引きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V_y=\\pi\\int_{-1}^{2}\\left(\\frac{2y+\\sqrt{5-y^2}}5\\right)^2dy-\\frac\\pi3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V_y=\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kitasato-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p011",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "原本解説は、(1)の増減表を(2)の概形へつなぎ、(3)は \\(\\pi\\int f(x)^2dx\\)、(4)は \\(\\pi\\int x^2dy\\) と立式する順序を示しています。上の解説もこの順序を保っています。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問　距離比から楕円と接線を作る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　距離条件をそのまま二乗する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2\\sqrt{(x-1)^2+y^2}=|4-x|",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "3x^2+4y^2=12\\Longrightarrow\\frac{x^2}{4}+\\frac{y^2}{3}=1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　接する条件は判別式0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(4m^2+3)x^2+8mnx+(4n^2-12)=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kitasato-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p012",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "D=0\\Longrightarrow n=\\sqrt{4m^2+3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "d=\\frac{\\sqrt{4m^2+3}}{\\sqrt{m^2+1}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　直交する2接線までの距離を合成する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "傾きmの接線と直交する接線の傾きは \\(-1/m\\) です。原点から2本の接線までの距離を長方形の半辺として合成します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "d'=\\frac{\\sqrt{3m^2+4}}{\\sqrt{m^2+1}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\mathrm{OP}=\\sqrt{d^2+d'^2}=\\sqrt7",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "m=0の軸平行の場合も \\(\\mathrm{OP}=\\sqrt{(\\sqrt3)^2+2^2}=\\sqrt7\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\pi\\,\\mathrm{OP}^2=7\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kitasato-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p013",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "原本解説の要点を確認する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "原本は、距離比から楕円を導き、連立2次方程式の重解条件で接線を決め、最後に直交する2接線までの距離から頂点Pの半径を求めています。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "長方形の辺と内部を原点の周りに回すと、半径OPの円全体を通過します。OPが向きによらず \\(\\sqrt7\\) で一定であることが、面積 \\(7\\pi\\) を得る中心です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
